## Third-Party Components

### Strategy Templates
The strategy template definitions in agent/src/lab/templates.json are adapted
from QuantDinger (https://github.com/QuantDinger/QuantDinger), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

### Alpha Factor Definitions
This product includes Microsoft Qlib feature definitions under the Apache 2.0
license. See agent/src/factors/zoo/qlib158/NOTICE for upstream attribution.

Mathematical formulas from the following sources are reimplemented in this
repository as factual mathematical content (formulas are not copyrightable):

  - Kakushadze, Z. (2015) "101 Formulaic Alphas" (arXiv:1601.00991)
  - Guotai Junan Securities (2014) "191 Short-period Trading Alpha Factors"
  - Fama-French five-factor model, Carhart momentum, Hou-Xue-Zhang q-factor
  - GTJA Research (2018) "191 Alphas" Part 2

Prose, tables, and figures from the source papers are NOT reproduced — only
the mathematical formulas are reimplemented.

### Skill Packs
The 87 skill packs in agent/src/skills/ contain knowledge documentation
covering quantitative trading strategies, technical analysis, risk management,
and market microstructure. Content is original or derived from publicly
available academic and practitioner literature.

